==Trivia==
*The Wind Blows' Japanese name, Sukimakaze no Sasayaki (隙間風のささやき, "Whisper of Draft"), may be a reference to the song "[https://youtu.be/TDVZZPze4Iw Kaze no Sasayaki]" (風のささやき, "Whisper of Wind") by [[wikipedia:Aimyon|Aimyon]]. The stage name is spelled exactly like the song, but with two more kanji added in front to turn ''Kaze'' (風, Wind) into ''Sukimakaze'' (隙間風, Draft).

